    "sub_name": "專業實習(一)",
    "sub_ename": "INTERNSHIP (1)",
    "describe_ch": "透過實習計畫書的申請確認學校與企業的協作方向，並由實習單位業師的實習週誌與指導教授雙周或月報的督導，在期末繳交專業技術報告並進行業師及指導教授的口試評分。學生每週依實習單位與學程研商結果在實習單位實習至少3天。",
    "describe_eh": "Based on the internship proposal submitted by applicant, the corporation directions are confirmed by both university and organization.  Supervised by the tutor of internship organization with weekly logs and bi-week or monthly reports from advisor, the student has to present his/her final technical report and attend the oral defense which is assessed by the internship tutor and advisor at the end of semester. Three days per week at least at the internship organization will be determined by university and organization.",
